        "summary": "Room-temperature χMT agrees with six uncoupled Gd(III) ions. χMT and a small positive Weiss constant indicate very weak ferromagnetic interactions together with antiferromagnetic interactions at low temperature. Magnetization saturates near the spin-only value, and the compound shows a magnetocaloric effect with −ΔSm = 27.81 J kg−1 K−1 at 3 K and 7 T.",
